 504:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 ptr to NULL before realloc(). If it is  owned  by  X,  it
 505:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 will call ae_free/x_free/aligned_free family functions.
 506:libs/alglib/src/ap.h **** 
 507:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****     last_action ACT_UNCHANGED, ACT_SAME_LOCATION, ACT_NEW_LOCATION
 508:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 contents is either: unchanged, stored at the same location,
 509:libs/alglib/src/ap.h ****                 stored at the new location.
