2294:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This function creates buffer  structure  which  can  be  used  to  perform
2295:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** parallel KD-tree requests.
2296:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2297:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** KD-tree subpackage provides two sets of request functions - ones which use
2298:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** internal buffer of KD-tree object  (these  functions  are  single-threaded
2299:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** because they use same buffer, which can not shared between  threads),  and
2300:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** ones which use external buffer.
2301:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2302:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This function is used to initialize external buffer.
2303:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2304:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
2305:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree which is associated with newly created buffer
2306:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2307:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
2308:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Buf         -   external buffer.
2309:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 109


2310:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2311:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: KD-tree buffer should be used only with  KD-tree  object  which
2312:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            was used to initialize buffer. Any attempt to use buffer   with
2313:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            different object is dangerous - you  may  get  integrity  check
2314:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            failure (exception) because sizes of internal arrays do not fit
2315:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            to dimensions of KD-tree structure.
2316:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2317:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
2318:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****      Copyright 18.03.2016 by Bochkanov Sergey
2319:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** *************************************************************************/
