2453:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
2454:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** K-NN query: K nearest neighbors, using external thread-local buffer.
2455:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2456:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** You can call this function from multiple threads for same kd-tree instance,
2457:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** assuming that different instances of buffer object are passed to different
2458:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** threads.
2459:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2460:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
2461:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   kd-tree
2462:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Buf         -   request buffer  object  created  for  this  particular
2463:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     instance of kd-tree structure with kdtreecreaterequestbuffer()
2464:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     function.
2465:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
2466:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     K           -   number of neighbors to return, K>=1
2467:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
2468:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
2469:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
2470:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
2471:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
2472:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
2473:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2474:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
2475:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of actual neighbors found (either K or N, if K>N).
2476:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2477:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
2478:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures  of  the  buffer object. You can use following  subroutines  to
2479:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** obtain these results (pay attention to "buf" in their names):
2480:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsX() to get X-values
