2482:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsTags() to get tag values
2483:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsDistances() to get distances
2484:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2485:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: kd-tree buffer should be used only with  KD-tree  object  which
2486:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            was used to initialize buffer. Any attempt to use biffer   with
2487:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            different object is dangerous - you  may  get  integrity  check
2488:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            failure (exception) because sizes of internal arrays do not fit
2489:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            to dimensions of KD-tree structure.
