2583:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       of kdtreequeryrnnu() and kdtreetsqueryrnnu() functions. Such queries
2584:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       are faster because we do not have to use heap structure for sorting.
2585:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
