2587:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
2588:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
2589:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
2590:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: kdtreetsqueryrnn() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
