2700:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** R-NN query: all points within R-sphere  centered  at  X,  no  ordering  by
2701:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** distance as undicated by "U" suffix (faster that ordered query, for  large
2702:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** queries - significantly faster).
2703:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2704:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function can not be used in multithreaded code because  it
2705:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
2706:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
2707:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
2708:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: kdtreetsqueryrnn() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
