2711:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
2712:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
2713:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     R           -   radius of sphere (in corresponding norm), R>0
2714:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
2715:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
2716:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
2717:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
