2818:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
2819:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** R-NN query: all points within  R-sphere  centered  at  X,  using  external
2820:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** thread-local buffer, sorted by distance between point and X (by ascending)
2821:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2822:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** You can call this function from multiple threads for same kd-tree instance,
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 118


2823:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** assuming that different instances of buffer object are passed to different
2824:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** threads.
2825:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2826:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTE: it is also possible to perform undordered queries performed by means
2827:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       of kdtreequeryrnnu() and kdtreetsqueryrnnu() functions. Such queries
2828:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       are faster because we do not have to use heap structure for sorting.
2829:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2830:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
2831:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
2832:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Buf         -   request buffer  object  created  for  this  particular
2833:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     instance of kd-tree structure with kdtreecreaterequestbuffer()
2834:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     function.
2835:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
2836:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     R           -   radius of sphere (in corresponding norm), R>0
2837:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
2838:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
2839:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
2840:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
2841:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
2842:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
2843:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2844:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
2845:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of neighbors found, >=0
2846:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2847:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
2848:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures  of  the  buffer object. You can use following  subroutines  to
2849:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** obtain these results (pay attention to "buf" in their names):
2850:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsX() to get X-values
2851:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsXY() to get X- and Y-values
2852:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsTags() to get tag values
2853:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsDistances() to get distances
2854:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2855:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: kd-tree buffer should be used only with  KD-tree  object  which
2856:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            was used to initialize buffer. Any attempt to use biffer   with
2857:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            different object is dangerous - you  may  get  integrity  check
2858:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            failure (exception) because sizes of internal arrays do not fit
2859:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            to dimensions of KD-tree structure.
2860:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2861:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
2862:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****      Copyright 18.03.2016 by Bochkanov Sergey
2863:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** *************************************************************************/
