2953:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
2954:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** R-NN query: all points within  R-sphere  centered  at  X,  using  external
2955:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** thread-local buffer, no ordering by distance as undicated  by  "U"  suffix
2956:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** (faster that ordered query, for large queries - significantly faster).
2957:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2958:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** You can call this function from multiple threads for same kd-tree instance,
2959:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** assuming that different instances of buffer object are passed to different
2960:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** threads.
2961:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2962:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
2963:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
2964:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Buf         -   request buffer  object  created  for  this  particular
2965:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     instance of kd-tree structure with kdtreecreaterequestbuffer()
2966:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     function.
2967:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
2968:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     R           -   radius of sphere (in corresponding norm), R>0
2969:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
2970:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
2971:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
2972:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
2973:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
2974:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
2975:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2976:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
2977:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of neighbors found, >=0
2978:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2979:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
2980:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures  of  the  buffer object. You can use following  subroutines  to
2981:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** obtain these results (pay attention to "buf" in their names):
2982:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsX() to get X-values
2983:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsXY() to get X- and Y-values
2984:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsTags() to get tag values
2985:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsDistances() to get distances
2986:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2987:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** As indicated by "U" suffix, this function returns unordered results.
2988:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
2989:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: kd-tree buffer should be used only with  KD-tree  object  which
2990:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            was used to initialize buffer. Any attempt to use biffer   with
2991:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            different object is dangerous - you  may  get  integrity  check
2992:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            failure (exception) because sizes of internal arrays do not fit
2993:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            to dimensions of KD-tree structure.
