3086:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
3087:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** K-NN query: approximate K nearest neighbors
3088:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3089:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function can not be used in multithreaded code because  it
3090:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
3091:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
3092:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
3093:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: KDTreeTsQueryAKNN() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
3094:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3095:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
3096:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
3097:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
3098:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     K           -   number of neighbors to return, K>=1
3099:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
3100:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
3101:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
3102:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
3103:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
3104:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
3105:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Eps         -   approximation factor, Eps>=0. eps-approximate  nearest
3106:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     neighbor  is  a  neighbor  whose distance from X is at
3107:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     most (1+eps) times distance of true nearest neighbor.
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 123


3108:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3109:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
3110:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of actual neighbors found (either K or N, if K>N).
3111:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3112:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTES
3113:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     significant performance gain may be achieved only when Eps  is  is  on
3114:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     the order of magnitude of 1 or larger.
3115:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3116:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
