3212:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** K-NN query: approximate K nearest neighbors, using thread-local buffer.
3213:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3214:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** You can call this function from multiple threads for same kd-tree instance,
3215:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** assuming that different instances of buffer object are passed to different
3216:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** threads.
3217:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3218:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
3219:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
3220:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Buf         -   request buffer  object  created  for  this  particular
3221:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     instance of kd-tree structure with kdtreecreaterequestbuffer()
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 125


3222:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     function.
3223:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
3224:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     K           -   number of neighbors to return, K>=1
3225:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
3226:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
3227:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
3228:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
3229:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
3230:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
3231:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Eps         -   approximation factor, Eps>=0. eps-approximate  nearest
3232:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     neighbor  is  a  neighbor  whose distance from X is at
3233:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     most (1+eps) times distance of true nearest neighbor.
3234:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3235:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
3236:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of actual neighbors found (either K or N, if K>N).
3237:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3238:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTES
3239:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     significant performance gain may be achieved only when Eps  is  is  on
3240:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     the order of magnitude of 1 or larger.
3241:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3242:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
3243:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures  of  the  buffer object. You can use following  subroutines  to
3244:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** obtain these results (pay attention to "buf" in their names):
