3246:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsXY() to get X- and Y-values
3247:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsTags() to get tag values
3248:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeTsQueryResultsDistances() to get distances
3249:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3250:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: kd-tree buffer should be used only with  KD-tree  object  which
