3351:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** Box query: all points within user-specified box.
3352:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3353:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function can not be used in multithreaded code because  it
3354:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
3355:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
3356:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
3357:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: KDTreeTsQueryBox() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
3358:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3359:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
3360:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
3361:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     BoxMin      -   lower bounds, array[0..NX-1].
3362:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     BoxMax      -   upper bounds, array[0..NX-1].
3363:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3364:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3365:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
3366:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of actual neighbors found (in [0,N]).
3367:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3368:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
3369:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures of the KD-tree. You can use  following  subroutines  to  obtain
3370:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** these results:
3371:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsX() to get X-values
3372:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsXY() to get X- and Y-values
3373:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsTags() to get tag values
3374:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsDistances() returns zeros for this request
3375:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3376:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTE: this particular query returns unordered results, because there is no
3377:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       meaningful way of  ordering  points.  Furthermore,  no 'distance' is
3378:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       associated with points - it is either INSIDE  or OUTSIDE (so request
3379:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       for distances will return zeros).
3380:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3381:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
3382:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****      Copyright 14.05.2016 by Bochkanov Sergey
