3469:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** X-values from last query.
3470:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3471:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This function retuns results stored in  the  internal  buffer  of  kd-tree
3472:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** object. If you performed buffered requests (ones which  use  instances  of
3473:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** kdtreerequestbuffer class), you  should  call  buffered  version  of  this
3474:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** function - kdtreetsqueryresultsx().
3475:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3476:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
3477:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT     -   KD-tree
3478:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X       -   possibly pre-allocated buffer. If X is too small to store
3479:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 result, it is resized. If size(X) is enough to store
3480:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 result, it is left unchanged.
3481:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3482:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
3483:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X       -   rows are filled with X-values
3484:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3485:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTES
3486:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 1. points are ordered by distance from the query point (first = closest)
3487:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 2. if  XY is larger than required to store result, only leading part  will
3488:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    be overwritten; trailing part will be left unchanged. So  if  on  input
3489:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    XY = [[A,B],[C,D]], and result is [1,2],  then  on  exit  we  will  get
3490:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    XY = [[1,2],[C,D]]. This is done purposely to increase performance;  if
3491:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    you want function  to  resize  array  according  to  result  size,  use
3492:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    function with same name and suffix 'I'.
3493:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3494:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** SEE ALSO
3495:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsXY()            X- and Y-values
3496:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsTags()          tag values
3497:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsDistances()     distances
3498:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
