3700:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 instance of kd-tree structure.
3701:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X       -   possibly pre-allocated buffer. If X is too small to store
3702:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 result, it is resized. If size(X) is enough to store
3703:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 result, it is left unchanged.
3704:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
3705:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
