6344:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
6345:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This function creates buffer  structure  which  can  be  used  to  perform
6346:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** parallel KD-tree requests.
6347:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6348:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** KD-tree subpackage provides two sets of request functions - ones which use
6349:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** internal buffer of KD-tree object  (these  functions  are  single-threaded
6350:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** because they use same buffer, which can not shared between  threads),  and
6351:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** ones which use external buffer.
6352:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6353:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This function is used to initialize external buffer.
6354:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6355:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
6356:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree which is associated with newly created buffer
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 180


6357:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6358:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
6359:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Buf         -   external buffer.
6360:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     
6361:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     
6362:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: KD-tree buffer should be used only with  KD-tree  object  which
6363:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            was used to initialize buffer. Any attempt to use buffer   with
6364:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            different object is dangerous - you  may  get  integrity  check
6365:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            failure (exception) because sizes of internal arrays do not fit
6366:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            to dimensions of KD-tree structure.
6367:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6368:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
6369:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****      Copyright 18.03.2016 by Bochkanov Sergey
6370:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** *************************************************************************/
