6390:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
6391:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** K-NN query: K nearest neighbors
6392:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6393:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function can not be used in multithreaded code because  it
6394:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
6395:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
6396:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
6397:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: KDTreeTsQueryKNN() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
6398:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6399:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
6400:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
6401:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
6402:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     K           -   number of neighbors to return, K>=1
6403:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
6404:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
6405:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
6406:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
6407:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
6408:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
6409:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6410:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
6411:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of actual neighbors found (either K or N, if K>N).
6412:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6413:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 181


6414:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures of the KD-tree. You can use  following  subroutines  to  obtain
6415:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** these results:
