6500:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
6501:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** R-NN query: all points within R-sphere centered at X, ordered by  distance
6502:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** between point and X (by ascending).
6503:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6504:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTE: it is also possible to perform undordered queries performed by means
6505:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       of kdtreequeryrnnu() and kdtreetsqueryrnnu() functions. Such queries
6506:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****       are faster because we do not have to use heap structure for sorting.
6507:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6508:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function can not be used in multithreaded code because  it
6509:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
6510:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
6511:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
6512:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: kdtreetsqueryrnn() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
6513:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6514:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
6515:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
6516:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
6517:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     R           -   radius of sphere (in corresponding norm), R>0
6518:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
6519:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
6520:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
6521:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
6522:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
6523:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
6524:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6525:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
6526:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of neighbors found, >=0
6527:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 183


6528:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
