6677:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** thread-local buffer, no ordering by distance as undicated  by  "U"  suffix
6678:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** (faster that ordered query, for large queries - significantly faster).
6679:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6680:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** You can call this function from multiple threads for same kd-tree instance,
6681:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** assuming that different instances of buffer object are passed to different
6682:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** threads.
6683:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
