6687:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     instance of kd-tree structure with kdtreecreaterequestbuffer()
6688:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     function.
6689:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
6690:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     R           -   radius of sphere (in corresponding norm), R>0
6691:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
6692:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
6693:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
6694:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
6695:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
6696:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
6697:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
