6738:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
6739:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** K-NN query: approximate K nearest neighbors
6740:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6741:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** IMPORTANT: this function can not be used in multithreaded code because  it
6742:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            uses internal temporary buffer of kd-tree object, which can not
6743:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            be shared between multiple threads.  If  you  want  to  perform
6744:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            parallel requests, use function  which  uses  external  request
6745:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****            buffer: KDTreeTsQueryAKNN() ("Ts" stands for "thread-safe").
6746:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6747:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
6748:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT         -   KD-tree
6749:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X           -   point, array[0..NX-1].
6750:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     K           -   number of neighbors to return, K>=1
6751:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     SelfMatch   -   whether self-matches are allowed:
6752:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if True, nearest neighbor may be the point itself
6753:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       (if it exists in original dataset)
6754:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if False, then only points with non-zero distance
6755:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                       are returned
ARM GAS  C:\Users\subdia\AppData\Local\Temp\ccLx3Sbr.s 			page 187


6756:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     * if not given, considered True
6757:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     Eps         -   approximation factor, Eps>=0. eps-approximate  nearest
6758:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     neighbor  is  a  neighbor  whose distance from X is at
6759:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                     most (1+eps) times distance of true nearest neighbor.
6760:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6761:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** RESULT
6762:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     number of actual neighbors found (either K or N, if K>N).
6763:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     
6764:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTES
6765:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     significant performance gain may be achieved only when Eps  is  is  on
6766:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     the order of magnitude of 1 or larger.
6767:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6768:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This  subroutine  performs  query  and  stores  its result in the internal
6769:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** structures of the KD-tree. You can use  following  subroutines  to  obtain
6770:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** these results:
6771:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsX() to get X-values
6772:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsXY() to get X- and Y-values
6773:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsTags() to get tag values
6774:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsDistances() to get distances
6775:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
6776:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
