7060:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** /*************************************************************************
7061:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** X-values from last query.
7062:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
7063:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** This function retuns results stored in  the  internal  buffer  of  kd-tree
7064:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** object. If you performed buffered requests (ones which  use  instances  of
7065:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** kdtreerequestbuffer class), you  should  call  buffered  version  of  this
7066:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** function - kdtreetsqueryresultsx().
7067:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
7068:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** INPUT PARAMETERS
7069:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     KDT     -   KD-tree
7070:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X       -   possibly pre-allocated buffer. If X is too small to store
7071:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 result, it is resized. If size(X) is enough to store
7072:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****                 result, it is left unchanged.
7073:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
7074:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** OUTPUT PARAMETERS
7075:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****     X       -   rows are filled with X-values
7076:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
7077:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** NOTES
7078:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 1. points are ordered by distance from the query point (first = closest)
7079:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 2. if  XY is larger than required to store result, only leading part  will
7080:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    be overwritten; trailing part will be left unchanged. So  if  on  input
7081:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    XY = [[A,B],[C,D]], and result is [1,2],  then  on  exit  we  will  get
7082:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    XY = [[1,2],[C,D]]. This is done purposely to increase performance;  if
7083:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    you want function  to  resize  array  according  to  result  size,  use
7084:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****    function with same name and suffix 'I'.
7085:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
7086:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** SEE ALSO
7087:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsXY()            X- and Y-values
7088:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsTags()          tag values
7089:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** * KDTreeQueryResultsDistances()     distances
7090:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** 
7091:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****   -- ALGLIB --
7092:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp ****      Copyright 28.02.2010 by Bochkanov Sergey
7093:libs/alglib/src/alglibmisc.cpp **** *************************************************************************/
